<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Voxware started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Voxware started with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it started Voxware Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Voxware shares rose 1/8 to 7-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Voxware went public in late October for $7.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- The New Jersey based company specializes in technology for speech processing. The offering was managed by Montgomery Securities, Alex. Brown, and Oppenheimer.</p>
</text>
